destroy table inet codestead_piston_guest
add table inet codestead_piston_guest
add chain inet codestead_piston_guest input { type filter hook input priority filter; policy drop; }
add chain inet codestead_piston_guest output { type filter hook output priority filter; policy drop; }
add rule inet codestead_piston_guest input ct state invalid drop
add rule inet codestead_piston_guest input iifname "lo" accept
add rule inet codestead_piston_guest input ct state established,related accept
add rule inet codestead_piston_guest input ip saddr 192.168.122.1 tcp dport 22 accept
add rule inet codestead_piston_guest input ip saddr 172.29.40.2 tcp dport 4100 accept
add rule inet codestead_piston_guest input udp sport 67 udp dport 68 accept
add rule inet codestead_piston_guest output oifname "lo" accept
add rule inet codestead_piston_guest output ct state established,related accept
add rule inet codestead_piston_guest output udp sport 68 udp dport 67 accept
add chain inet codestead_piston_guest forward { type filter hook forward priority filter; policy drop; }
